{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"34":"Clothing (Kitab Al-Libas)"},"section_detail":{"34":{"hadithnumber_first":4020,"hadithnumber_last":4158,"arabicnumber_first":4020,"arabicnumber_last":4158,"name_native":"পোষাক-পরিচ্ছদ অধ্যায়"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4046,"arabicnumber":4046,"text":"। ইবরাহীম ইবনু আব্দুল্লাহ (রাঃ) সূত্রে এ হাদীস বর্ণিত। এতে আরো রয়েছেঃ ‘‘আমি এ কথা বলছি না যে, তিনি তোমাদেরকে তা নিষেধ করেছেন।’’[1] হাসান সহীহ।","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Hasan"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":34,"hadith":27}}]}